<h2>Task Overdue</h2>

<p>Hello,</p>

<p>
  The following task has passed its deadline and is still not completed.
</p>

<h3><%= @task.title %></h3>

<table>
  <tr>
    <td><strong>Project:</strong></td>
    <td><%= @project.name %></td>
  </tr>

  <tr>
    <td><strong>End Date:</strong></td>
    <td><%= @task.end_date %></td>
  </tr>

  <tr>
    <td><strong>Days Overdue:</strong></td>
    <td><%= @overdue_days %></td>
  </tr>

  <tr>
    <td><strong>Status:</strong></td>
    <td><%= @task.status.humanize %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>
  Please complete the task as soon as possible.
</p>

<p>
  This reminder will continue until the task is marked as completed.
</p>

<p>
  Regards,<br>
  Employee Project Management System
</p>